    "DASHBOARD_DESCR": "Consolidated asset, depreciation and verification KPIs for the Asset/Finance Manager. Assumption: only fam_warranty_amc_expiry (V, Grid) exists on disk today; the other 10 tiles below reference visual obj_names (fam_total_gross_asset_value, fam_total_net_book_value, fam_assets_pending_approval, fam_warranty_amc_expiring_30d, fam_asset_value_by_category, fam_asset_count_by_location, fam_monthly_depreciation_trend_ca, fam_depreciation_comparison_ca_it, fam_physical_verification_status, fam_asset_disposal_value_waterfall, fam_depreciation_posting_compliance) that are expected to be materialised by a follow-up visual-authoring pass / the cascading visual generator, using financial_year/branch_code as their prompt vars to match this dashboard's CRITERIA_BINDINGS (mirrors the branch_code convention already used by fam_warranty_amc_expiry). Assumption: BRANCH_CODE defaults to All ('%') rather than the logged-in user's branch, since a per-session default cannot be expressed in a static dashboard model; the user can pick their own branch via the FAM_BRANCH_MASTER lookup. Assumption: drill-through to Asset Register Report and Depreciation Register (obj_type R print reports, and not yet declared as project objects) is intentionally left unwired, since this dashboard's DRILL_THROUGH only targets dashboard/visual/self, not a report; only the Warranty/AMC Expiring card drills through today, to the existing fam_warranty_amc_expiry visual.",
    "CREATED_BY": "admin",
    "CREATED_DATE": "2026-08-01",
    "REFRESH_INTERVAL_SECONDS": 0,

    "GLOBAL_CRITERIA": [
      {
        "PARAM_NAME": "FINANCIAL_YEAR",
        "PROMPT_LABEL": "Financial Year",
        "DEFAULT_VALUE": "2026-27",
        "DATA_TYPE": "string",
        "OPERATOR": "=",
        "BROADCAST_TO": [
          "VIS_001", "VIS_002", "VIS_007", "VIS_008", "VIS_010", "VIS_011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "PARAM_NAME": "BRANCH_CODE",
        "PROMPT_LABEL": "Branch",
        "DEFAULT_VALUE": "%",
        "DATA_TYPE": "string",
        "OPERATOR": "like",
        "BROADCAST_TO": [
          "VIS_001", "VIS_002", "VIS_003", "VIS_004", "VIS_005", "VIS_006",
          "VIS_007", "VIS_008", "VIS_009", "VIS_010", "VIS_011"
        ],
        "lookup": "FAM_BRANCH_MASTER(BRANCH_NAME, BRANCH_CODE)",
